{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2613"},"reason":"Added a sentence on host slogans with Sochi's \"Hot. Cool. Yours.\", for the moved fact f14106.","by":"one-question split worker 0","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",373],["+"," Alongside this permanent motto, every host coins a slogan of its own: Sochi chose \"Hot. Cool. Yours.\" for the 2014 Winter Games."],["=",570]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",345],["+"," Neben diesem dauerhaften Motto prägt jeder Gastgeber einen eigenen Slogan: Sotschi wählte für die Winterspiele 2014 „Hot. Cool. Yours.“"],["=",510]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",329],["+"," Помимо этого постоянного девиза каждый хозяин Игр придумывает собственный слоган: Сочи выбрал для зимних Игр 2014 года слоган «Hot. Cool. Yours.» — по-русски «Жаркие. Зимние. Твои.»."],["=",512]]}],"hash":"905b5e0c95d6"},
